  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.1.0 (no breaking changes)\n      - HttpVersion(...): HTTP/2 and HTTP/3\n      - Proxy(IWebProxy?) and SystemProxy()\n      - Cookies(CookieContainer?): per-builder cookie session\n      - Route(name, value): URL templates (\"users/{id}\")\n      - Authentication / BearerToken with an asynchronous token provider\n      - RestResult.Problem (Problem Details, RFC 9457) and RestResult.ErrorAs<T>()\n      - Metrics: Meter \"Mafesoft.RestClient\" (request duration, retries, refresh token), ClientName(...)\n      - GetAsyncEnumerable<T>(): stream a JSON array as IAsyncEnumerable<T>\n      - GetEventsAsync<T>() / PostEventsAsync<T>(): Server-Sent Events\n\n      Full changelog: https://github.com/fmazzant/RestClient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
